 10716.63, "timestamp": "02:58:36", "text": "购买用户界面。呃，这边这个你可以买。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10718.389, "timestamp": "02:58:38", "text": "任何事物。只要你愿意，我什么都让你买。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10720.55, "timestamp": "02:58:40", "text": "你想要什么。但我建议你试试看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10722.309, "timestamp": "02:58:42", "text": "先买点东西看看是否可行"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10724.07, "timestamp": "02:58:44", "text": "实际上有效，因为我不知道为什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10725.75, "timestamp": "02:58:45", "text": "你的浏览器有时候不会出现问题"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10726.79, "timestamp": "02:58:46", "text": "工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10729.99, "timestamp": "02:58:49", "text": "对，就想想买什么吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10731.91, "timestamp": "02:58:51", "text": "等等，如果我刷新页面会发生什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10735.429, "timestamp": "02:58:55", "text": "页？呃，什么也没发生。就像你一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10737.11, "timestamp": "02:58:57", "text": "如果你想的话，可以试试。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10739.59, "timestamp": "02:58:59", "text": "我会关闭广告拦截器并点赞"}]